[{"id":"426","date":"2026-10-02T23:33:30+00:00","text":"Kaseya Center’s entrance banner has been updated to “Welcome to Vice City” after the HEAT x Rockstar Games announcement. @RockstarGames 😠","image":"https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/lRsawjvDgpwF3kjO9Z8CTHHYhMIv54t6leEyHmByIuke9hABlkw0VuWvf-1TCtMzsrDj9Ac3ibkTD7LkF_8tZvryaPcoG3GwNpD_u2QdLIbloFcKz5q0vLYiw7V99TQsSMMdCO54c0cOBBcuPpNgHukNGLkntSuRDcsUoRF938Xxa06pcI-oAgX1l4K2e0iVfhc-QMME07p8F-cmcee6DMG0Xfg-I0UEJZWviK2u0PJYkYkyk6dyIMYCSedhXMQieKVEYgxyBQeg5a8ZguCJOsrejgxVkLtE6B817rIqatNPkC3o9W_nCiR3MZqbkhtKxjlE7dOAX2amiRCWQ9SAfA.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"425","date":"2026-10-02T19:48:48+00:00","text":"","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"417","date":"2026-10-02T19:43:15+00:00","text":"French magazine “LOVE” has announced a GTA 6 feature in its upcoming Issue 27, with a new artwork of Jason and Lucia: - The magazine interviewed Rockstar North co-studio head Rob Nelson - Rob Nelson says Rockstar hopes players will want to “escape into these worlds and these characters and get lost with them and in them” - The interview focuses on Rockstar’s approach to world-building, characters, and creating an immersive world where every character feels meaningful - The physical issue will be available October 5 @RockstarGames 😠","image":"https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/qOKfvsZPjAJqwleKLl2lrs6iR-5hyQYrFwtJIRXXuwCOj2FhBDnPXcg50qlhWI8I0N_VkAjR-rFKYE5QKf70sn60E9gxGxAW4uYsV7EXQTyknpxF55sNPECFmY-GTocH9koMzdtVeM2rN3qKYiMsEg_ic-iylAokhzlgMA5H71UOXUPs-WkADbBB27dx4Z_T9qdt7NOTH7vsiyYQAfY3yQHR6L3xYSDTwkMIZQh94W_Wd4-OdwAQOneqs2Yj7t_w0HQzjzph2pyaMlqWyOvYemes_KI0e0FsMcMKmzLRXOMPfjhs8F3ApP-b7AHTi1DX36gvQ0ZYOIbGNLaBbV15oQ.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"416","date":"2026-10-02T19:42:40+00:00","text":"Rockstar Games is officially teaming up with the Miami HEAT for a special “Night in Vice City” on November 18 at the Kaseya Center. The HEAT will temporarily rebrand as Vice City and face the Milwaukee Bucks, featuring: - An all-